hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"956","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muawiya ne humein khabar di, Amash se, Abu Razeen se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Maine unhein dekha ke woh apne haath se apni peshani maar rahe thay aur keh rahe thay: Aye ahl-e-Iraq, kya tum guman karte ho ke main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam par jhoot bolta hoon, kya tumhare liye khushi ho aur mere zimme gunah ho? Main gawahi deta hoon ke beshak maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se kisi ki juti ka tasma toot jaye to woh apni dusri juti mein na chale hatta ke usay durust kar le."
"957","Abu Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub bin Abi Tamima ne hum se bayan kiya, Abul Aaliya al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Mere paas se Hazrat Abdullah bin Samit guzre to maine un ke liye kursi bichhai to woh baith gaye to maine un se kaha: Beshak Ibn Ziyad ne namaz ko muakkhar kar diya hai to aap kya hukm dete hain? To unhon ne meri raan par ek martaba mara, mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: hatta ke us mein nishan daal diya, phir unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Abu Zarr se sawal kiya jaisa tum ne mujh se sawal kiya to unhon ne meri raan par mara jaisa maine tumhari raan par mara, phir unhon ne kaha: Namaz ko us ke waqt par parho, phir agar tum un ke saath pao to parho aur na kaho: Tahqeeq maine parh li hai, pas main nahi parhoonga."
"958","Abu al-Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib ne humein khabar di, Zuhri se, Salim bin Abdullah se, ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar ne unhein khabar di ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saath aap ke sahaba mein se ek jamaat mein Ibn Sayyad ki taraf nikle hatta ke unhon ne usay paya ke woh Bani Mughala ke qila mein bachchon ke saath khel raha tha aur us din Ibn Sayyad baloghat ke qareeb tha, pas usay khabar na hui hatta ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apne haath se us ki peeth par mara, phir farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Allah ka Rasool hoon? To us ne un ki taraf dekha phir us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hoon ke aap ummiyon ke Rasool hain, Ibn Sayyad ne kaha: To kya aap gawahi dete hain ke main Allah ka Rasool hoon? To Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne usay daba diya phir farmaya: Main Allah aur us ke Rasool par iman laya, phir Ibn Sayyad se kaha: Tum kya dekhte ho? To Ibn Sayyad ne kaha: Mere paas sachcha aur jhoota aata hai, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum par muamla mushtabah kar diya gaya hai, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak maine tumhare liye ek chhupi hui cheez chhupai hai, us ne kaha: Woh ad-dukh hai, aap ne farmaya: Door ho, tum apni qadr se aage nahi barhe, Umar ne kaha: Aye Rasoolullah, kya aap mujhe is mein ijazat dete hain ke main us ki gardan maar doon? To Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Agar woh wahi hai to tum us par musallat nahi kiye jaoge, aur agar woh wahi nahi hai to us ke qatl mein tumhare liye koi bhalai nahi."
"959","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Hazrat Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab junubi hote to apne sar par pani ke teen lap daalte, Hasan bin Muhammad ne kaha: Aye Abu Abdullah, beshak mere baal is se zyada hain, unhon ne"
"960","Hamein Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abu Awana ne bayan kiya, Aamash se, Abu Sufyan se, Hazrat Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Madineh mein ghore se khajoor ke tane par gir pare, pas Aap ka qadam utar gaya, to hum Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ke mashrubah mein Aap ki ayadat karte the, pas hum Aap ke pas aaye aur Aap baithe hue namaz parh rahe the, to hum ne khare ho kar namaz parhi, phir hum dobara Aap ke pas aaye aur Aap farz namaz baithe hue parh rahe the, to hum ne Aap ke peeche khare ho kar namaz parhi, to Aap ne hamein ishara kiya keh baith jao, pas jab Aap ne namaz poori ki to farmaya: Jab imam baithe hue namaz parhe to tum baithe hue namaz parho, aur jab woh khara ho kar namaz parhe to tum khare ho kar namaz parho, aur imam ke baithe hone ke bawajood khare na raho jaisa keh Faris apne baron ke sath karte hain."
"961","Unhon ne kaha: Aur Ansar mein se fulan shakhs ke han ek ladka paida hua, to us ne us ka naam Muhammad rakha, to Ansar ne kaha: Hum tumhein Rasoolullah ki kunniyat se kunniyat nahin denge, yahan tak keh hum raaste mein baithe un se Qayamat ke bare mein poochhne lage, to unhon ne farmaya: Tum mere pas Qayamat ke bare mein poochhne aaye ho, hum ne kaha: Ji han, unhon ne farmaya: Koi jaandar jaan aisi nahin jis par sau baras guzren, hum ne kaha: Ansar mein se fulan ke han ek ladka paida hua to us ne us ka naam Muhammad rakha, to Ansar ne kaha: Hum tumhein Rasoolullah ki kunniyat se kunniyat nahin denge, unhon ne farmaya: Ansar ne khoob kaha, mere naam par naam rakho aur meri kunniyat par kunniyat na rakho."
"962","Hamein Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Darawardi ne bayan kiya, Jafar se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se keh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam bazar mein se guzre is haal mein keh Aap Aaliya ke kisi hisse se dakhil ho rahe the aur log Aap ke dono pahluon par the, pas Aap chhote kanon wale bakri ke bache ke pas se guzre, to Aap ne use pakra pas us ka kaan pakda phir farmaya: Tum mein se kaun pasand karta hai keh yeh us ka ek dirham ke badle ho, to unhon ne kaha: Hum pasand nahin karte keh yeh kisi qeemat par hamara ho, aur hum is ka kya karenge, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum pasand karte ho keh yeh tumhara ho, unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne yeh baat un se teen martaba kahi, to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam nahin, agar yeh zinda hota tab bhi is mein aib hota keh yeh asak hai, aur asak woh hai jis ke do kaan na hon, to jab keh yeh murda hai to kaisa, Aap ne farmaya: To Allah ki qasam, duniya Allah ke nazdeek is se bhi zyada haqeer hai jitna yeh tumhare nazdeek hai."
"963","Hamein Usman Muazzin ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Awf ne bayan kiya, Hasan se, Utayy bin Zamra se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ubayy ke pas ek shakhs ko dekha jo jahiliyyat ki asabiyyat ke sath fakhar kar raha tha, to Ubayy ne use sareeh lafz kaha aur kinaya na kiya, to us ke sathiyon ne us ki taraf dekha, unhon ne kaha: Goya tum ne is baat ko bura jana, pas unhon ne kaha: Main is bare mein kabhi kisi se nahin darta, maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo jahiliyyat ki asabiyyat ke sath fakhar kare to use sareeh lafz kaho aur kinaya na karo."
"964","Hamein Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdur Rahman bin Saad se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ki tang sun ho gayi, to ek shakhs ne un se kaha: Apne mehboob tareen shakhs ko yaad karo, to unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad."
"965","Hamein Musaddad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Yahya ne bayan kiya, Usman bin Ghiyas se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abu Usman ne bayan kiya, Hazrat Abu Musa se keh woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath Madineh ke baghat mein se ek bagh mein the, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke hath mein ek lakdi thi jis se Aap pani aur g960|||Hamein Musa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abu Awana ne bayan kiya, Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Hazrat Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Madina me ghore se khajoor ke tane par gir pare to Aap ka paon ukhar gaya, to hum Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha ke balakhane me Aap ki ayadat karte the, pas hum Aap ke pas aaye aur Aap baithe namaz parh rahe the to hum ne khare ho kar namaz parhi, phir hum dobara aaye aur Aap farz namaz baithe parh rahe the to hum ne Aap ke peeche khare ho kar parhi to Aap ne ishara kiya keh baith jao, pas jab namaz mukammal ki to farmaya: Jab imam baithe namaz parhe to tum baithe parho aur jab khare ho kar parhe to khare ho kar parho, aur imam ke baithe hote hue khare na raho jaise Fars apne baron ke sath karte hain."
"966","Hamein Ibn Shayba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Ibn Nubata ne bayan kiya, Salama bin Wardan se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Anas bin Malik ko logon se musafaha karte dekha, to unhon ne mujh se poochha: Tum kaun ho, to maine kaha: Bani Lais ka aazad karda hun, to unhon ne mere sar par teen martaba hath phera aur kaha: Allah tumhein barkat de."
"967","Hamein Hajjaj ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Hammad bin Salama ne bayan kiya, Humayd se, Hazrat Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ahl e Yaman aaye to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ahl e Yaman aa gaye aur woh tum se zyada narm dil hain, pas woh sab se pehle hain jo musafaha lekar aaye."
"968","Muhammad bin as Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Ismail bin Zakariya ne hum se bayan kiya Abu Jafar al Farra se Abdullah bin Yazid se Hazrat Bara bin Azib se unhon ne farmaya Tahiyyat ke tamam hone me se hai ke tum apne bhai se musafaha karo"
